    - plant trees
    hint: One tree absorbs\n 22 kgs of CO2 each year
    knowledgeFact: fact1
  - questionText: " <size=60>Guess This? \\n      Reduce  \U0001F697\U0001F9B4  
      \U0001F463</size>"
    correctAnswers:
    - carbon footprint
    hint: \n 10-15% of global emissions \n come from deforestation! \n Process to
      bring that \n number down
    knowledgeFact: fact11
  - questionText: ' <size=60>Solve This Riddle!</size>\n <size=180>Waste</size> <size=100>Waste</size>
      <size=60>Waste</size> <size=30>Waste</size>'
    correctAnswers:
    - reduce waste
    - waste reduction
    - waste reduce
    hint: This helps to protect\n marine animals
    knowledgeFact: fact2
  - questionText: " <size=60>Can You Guess This Quote? \\n      \U0001F914\U0001F49A\U0001F3AC\U0001F49A
      </size>"
    correctAnswers:
    - think green act green
    hint: This thought can save \n up to 30%  of electricity \nannually
    knowledgeFact: fact3
  - questionText: " <size=60>\"I\u2019m clean and green, a planet\u2019s dream,\\n     
      I work with the sun, wind, and stream\". What am I?</size>"
    correctAnswers:
