    hint: Solar Energy
    knowledgeFact: fact4
  - questionText: " <size=60>\"I don\u2019t drink gas, I don\u2019t need a snack,
      \\n      Just plug me in, and I\u2019m back on track.\"What am I? </size>"
    correctAnswers:
    - EV
    - electric car
    - electric vehicle
    hint: Tesla
    knowledgeFact: fact5
  - questionText: " <size=60>Guess This Astrobolt! \\n      \u2B07\U0001F4A7</size>"
    correctAnswers:
    - save water
    hint: Action that keeps us \n from running dry
    knowledgeFact: fact6
  - questionText: " <size=60>Guess This Quote! \\n     \U0001F4A7 is \U0001F343</size>"
    correctAnswers:
    - water is life
    hint: \n Less than 1% of Earth's \nwater is accessible for \nhuman use
    knowledgeFact: fact7
  - questionText: " <size=60>Can You Solve This Riddle? \\n     \U0001F6B2\u21A9  
